  "causalSequence": [
    "slice eggplant 5 mm-1 cm; salt 20-30 min to draw moisture",
    "pat dry, brush with olive oil; roast or grill until golden and tender",
    "soften onion, add garlic; brown mince, drain fat",
    "stir in tomato paste, oregano, cinnamon, spices; add tomatoes, wine, stock; simmer 15-30 min until thick",
    "bechamel: cook flour in butter or oil 1-3 min; whisk in warm milk; simmer until it coats a spoon",
    "off heat season with nutmeg, cheese; temper beaten egg into bechamel",
    "layer half eggplant, all meat sauce, remaining eggplant; pour bechamel over, spread to edges",
    "top with breadcrumbs or extra parmesan",
    "bake 175 C 45-60 min until golden and set",
    "rest 10-30 min before slicing"
  ],
  "techniqueFacts": [
    "all three salt eggplant slices before cooking to pull moisture and bitterness",
    "all three pre-cook the eggplant (roast/broil/grill) before layering; one notes this prevents a watery bake",
    "all three temper a beaten egg into the finished bechamel so the topping sets sliceable",
    "cinnamon in the meat sauce in all three (ground in two, whole stick fished out in one)",
    "all three rest the baked dish 10-30 min for clean slices",
    "two warm the milk before whisking into the roux",
    "wine deglaze in all three but flagged optional in one",
    "one source builds the bechamel on olive oil instead of butter",
    "lamb is the preferred mince; two sources allow beef interchangeably"
  ],
